{"UUID":"b0a8a660-2409-4be2-b37e-8e2a2c6c9b34","DebugName":"HaulCargo_SingleToMulti4_Processed_Stims_Stanton3_SmallGrade","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Legacy","MissionType":{"UUID":"ae6021b6-6a62-470e-9cc2-025f1e44ade2","Name":"Hauling - Planetary"},"MissionGiver":"Covalex Independent Contractors","Title":"~mission(ReputationRank) Rank - ~mission(CargoGradeToken) Cargo Haul","TitleKey":"Covalex_HaulCargo_SingleToMulti_title","DisplayTitle":"Member Rank - Small Cargo Haul","Description":"Hi,\n\nThere\u2019s a load of stims at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> ready to be picked up from a freight elevator and delivered to a few spots. They will be packaged up in containers <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize)</EM4> or smaller. Any chance you can knock this one out for me? \n\nDoesn\u2019t matter what order you drop them off.    \n\nDROP OFF LOCATIONS (ANY ORDER)\n\n~mission(SingleToMultiToken)\n\nGlad I never picked up the habit myself because I swear I get more delivery update requests for \u201cwhere are my stims?!?\u201d than any other kind of shipment. \n\nBy the way, we strongly encourage contractors to bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> along.   \n\n~mission(Contractor|SignOff)\n\nChase Hewitt\nJr. Logistics Coordinator\nCovalex Shipping  \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.","DescriptionKey":"Covalex_HaulCargo_SingleToMulti_Processed_Stims","DisplayDescription":"Hi,\n\nThere\u2019s a load of stims at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> ready to be picked up from a freight elevator and delivered to a few spots. They will be packaged up in containers <EM4>4 SCU</EM4> or smaller. Any chance you can knock this one out for me? \n\nDoesn\u2019t matter what order you drop them off.    \n\nDROP OFF LOCATIONS (ANY ORDER)\n\n- Freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination|Address]</EM4>\n- Freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination1|Address]</EM4>\n- Freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination2|Address]</EM4>\n- Freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination3|Address]</EM4>\n\nGlad I never picked up the habit myself because I swear I get more delivery update requests for \u201cwhere are my stims?!?\u201d than any other kind of shipment. \n\nBy the way, we strongly encourage contractors to bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> along.   \n\n[Contractor|SignOff]\n\nChase Hewitt\nJr. Logistics Coordinator\nCovalex Shipping  \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.","LocationPools":{"PickupLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Location","ResolvedLocations":[]},"DropoffLocation1BP":{"Purpose":"Destination","ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"ae5d91af-02df-4e51-9132-8d1995728202","LocationTemplateUUID":"ae5d91af-02df-4e51-9132-8d1995728202","Name":"Wala Derelict Outpost"},{"UUID":"e754bd91-319a-48af-8a44-12a424071713","LocationTemplateUUID":"e754bd91-319a-48af-8a44-12a424071713","Name":"ArcCorp Mining Area 045"},{"UUID":"a4c40709-84ee-450c-b7e9-bdb215e38421","LocationTemplateUUID":"a4c40709-84ee-450c-b7e9-bdb215e38421","Name":"Derelict Outpost"},{"UUID":"0d553e01-c0da-4d87-89bf-1f6466106e5a","LocationTemplateUUID":"0d553e01-c0da-4d87-89bf-1f6466106e5a","Name":"Derelict Outpost"},{"UUID":"a5fcc086-fe7c-4688-b914-4ecd8094756d","LocationTemplateUUID":"a5fcc086-fe7c-4688-b914-4ecd8094756d","Name":"Lyria Derelict Outpost"},{"UUID":"435be5b5-fd33-41df-a0d6-7e07